{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-5","kind":"proposition","title":"等腰三角形：等边对等角","englishTitle":"In isosceles triangles the angles at the base are equal to one another, and, if the equal straight lines be produced further, the angles under the base will be equal to one another.","book":1,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","contentId":"euclid-1-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82d3eac15c33453eec0b977322fee86ebf4c6f395a2773f69ba726f34c79bfa8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-5.statement","euclid-1-5.construction.1","euclid-1-5.proof.1","euclid-1-5.construction.2","euclid-1-5.proof.2","euclid-1-5.proof.3","euclid-1-5.proof.4","euclid-1-5.proof.5","euclid-1-5.proof.6","euclid-1-5.conclusion","euclid-1-5.historical.1","euclid-1-5.historical.2","euclid-1-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5109a9ef6e78727c93b7a2a6532901eec13f160c885af53fd77229e923cbb5fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In isosceles triangles the angles at the base are equal to one another, and, if the equal straight lines be produced further, the angles under the base will be equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等腰三角形,底边的角对等,如果相同的直线进一步延伸,底边的角对等。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形若两腰等，则底线两端之两角等，而两腰引出之其底之外两角亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个三角形的两条边相等，那么底边两端的两个角相等，从底边延伸出去的两个外角也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ffcc17a31c95e7404452285b1ba8a43e76c996f88d331fe20a459fa363df4fe","citations":["euclid-1-post-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be an isosceles triangle having the side AB equal to the side AC; and let the straight lines BD, CE be produced further in a straight line with AB, AC. [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC是等腰三角形,AB等于AC;让BD,CE直线进一步延伸,以AB,AC直线。 [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e29db2ad052c4d941be91a023cc5dd3fed1183123ed93186c3ffe5383c55efc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle ABC is equal to the angle ACB, and the angle CBD to the angle BCE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,ABC角等于ACB角,CBD角等于BCE角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dd98ffcde3f89c17095bb02ce32a7f54379749f724723fab40ac38fcabff8434","citations":["euclid-1-3","euclid-1-post-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a point F be taken at random on BD; from AE the greater let AG be cut off equal to AF the less; [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] and let the straight lines FC, GB be joined. [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD随机取F点;AE的较大数量使AG的截断等于AF的较小数量;FC的直线与GB的连接。 [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"459f0d8f1ae3933bf2af192297d8920b14d91783e2cf0589cce3fed860febfab","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AF is equal to AG and AB to AC, the two sides FA, AC are equal to the two sides GA, AB, respectively; and they contain a common angle, the angle FAG. Therefore the base FC is equal to the base GB, and the triangle AFC is equal to the triangle AGB, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend, that is, the angle ACF to the angle ABG, and the angle AFC to the angle AGB. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于AF等于AG和AB至AC,双方的FA、AC等于双方的GA、AB;它们包含一个共同角度,即角度FAG。 因此,底边 FC等于底边 GB,三角形AFC等于三角形AGB,其余角度将分别与其余角度相等,即平等方向ABG倾斜的角ACF和向AGB倾角的角AFC。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20669bbce87f64ff1b79c16c0cc84f72c885d77ab4c110bee2e625fa1beab2d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the whole AF is equal to the whole AG, and in these AB is equal to AC, the remainder BF is equal to the remainder CG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且,由于整个AF等于AG, 在这AB中,AC, 其余BF等于其余的CG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"215173c12a8d71aa1b0cf2aa2b860b875bbef17bf5e56634a1d7a8c7ff41a292","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FC was also proved equal to GB; therefore the two sides BF, FC are equal to the two sides CG, GB respectively; and the angle BFC is equal to the angle CGB, while the base BC is common to them; therefore the triangle BFC is also equal to the triangle CGB, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend; therefore the angle FBC is equal to the angle GCB, and the angle BCF to the angle CBG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FC也证明等于GB;因此,双方的BF、FC分别等于CG、GB;BFC角等于CGB角,而底边个BC角是它们共有的;因此,三角BFC角也等于三角CGB角,其余角将分别等于其余的角,即平等两侧所支持的角;因此,FBC角等于GCB角,BCF角等于CBG角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b55e375d02f94476a0430589ecabf8d8822a994f53332ca023d35f1ca2a5f06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Accordingly, since the whole angle ABG was proved equal to the angle ACF, and in these the angle CBG is equal to the angle BCF, the remaining angle ABC is equal to the remaining angle ACB; and they are at the base of the triangle ABC. But the angle FBC was also proved equal to the angle GCB; and they are under the base."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,由于整个角度ABG与角度ACF相等,而在此角度CBG与角度BCF相等,其余角度ABC等于剩余角度ACB;它们位于三角形ABC的底边;但FBC的角度也与角度GCB相等;它们低于角度底边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62405c72222a559fddb09d11216f8bb4de2abd0cee12f75ebc5c9d5dbe976d06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形若两腰等，则底线两端之两角等，而两腰引出之其底之外两角亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个三角形的两条边相等，那么底边两端的两个角相等，从底边延伸出去的两个外角也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff86c4fb063492c14cf69ce7572d873404603d9edcfa99694a68118a21bb56ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试如甲戊线稍长，即从甲戊截取一分与甲丁等，为甲己。〈本篇三。〉次自丙至丁、乙至己各作直线，〈第一求。〉即甲己乙、甲丁丙两三角形必等。何者此两形之甲角同，甲己与甲丁两腰又等，甲乙与甲丙两腰又等，则其底丙丁与乙己必等，而底线两端相当之，各两角亦等矣，〈本篇四。〉又乙丙己与丙乙丁两三角形亦等。何者此两形之丙丁乙与乙己丙两角既等，〈本论。〉而甲己、甲丁两腰各减相等之甲丙、甲乙线，即所存丙己、乙丁两腰又等，〈公论三。〉丙丁与乙己两底又等，〈本论。〉又乙丙同腰，即乙丙丁与丙乙己两角亦等也，则丙之外乙丙己角与乙之外丙乙丁角必等矣。〈本篇四。〉次观甲乙己与甲丙丁两角既等，于甲乙己减丙乙己角、甲丙丁减乙丙丁角，则所存甲丙乙与甲乙丙两角必等。〈公论三。〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试如甲戊线稍长，即从甲戊截取一分与甲丁等，为甲己。〈本篇三。〉次自丙至丁、乙至己各作直线，〈第一求。〉即甲己乙、甲丁丙两三角形必等。何者此两形之甲角同，甲己与甲丁两腰又等，甲乙与甲丙两腰又等，则其底丙丁与乙己必等，而底线两端相当之，各两角亦等矣，〈本篇四。〉又乙丙己与丙乙丁两三角形亦等。何者此两形之丙丁乙与乙己丙两角既等，〈本论。〉而甲己、甲丁两腰各减相等之甲丙、甲乙线，即所存丙己、乙丁两腰又等，〈公论三。〉丙丁与乙己两底又等，〈本论。〉又乙丙同腰，即乙丙丁与丙乙己两角亦等也，则丙之外乙丙己角与乙之外丙乙丁角必等矣。〈本篇四。〉次观甲乙己与甲丙丁两角既等，于甲乙己减丙乙己角、甲丙丁减乙丙丁角，则所存甲丙乙与甲乙丙两角必等。〈公论三。〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-5.source","contentId":"euclid-1-5","revisionId":"euclid-1-5@raw-82d3eac15c33453e","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b79ecc8edaf88ebd38ee2b4cfec48e796dab40bad60f427ae1d0c63fe4b322f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-5:euclid